---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | FabiTech">
	<section class="reading">
		<header class="article-header">
			<p class="eyebrow">Information</p>
			<h1>About This Site</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				Independent tech guides, Linux &amp; Windows configurations, and system notes.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="article-body">
			<h2>How to Create a New Post</h2>
			<p>
				Create a new folder inside the year directory (e.g. <code>src/content/posts/2026/my-new-guide/</code>) and place your Markdown file (<code>my-new-guide.md</code>) and images (<code>thumb.svg</code>, photos) inside it. The Markdown filename determines the URL (<code>domain.de/my-new-guide/</code>):
			</p>
			<pre><code>---
title: "My New Guide"
description: "Quick summary of the post."
pubDate: 2026-10-17
category: "Linux"
image: "./thumb.svg"
tags: ["linux", "cli"]
---

Write your Markdown content here...</code></pre>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
